---
import Documentation from "@layouts/Documentation.astro";
import { Typography } from "@ui-library";
---

<Documentation title="Support - Documentation">
  <Fragment slot="main-content">
    <Typography variant="heading2" as="h1">Support</Typography>
    <Typography variant="body-small">
      If you run into any issues, have questions, or need guidance while using
      this theme, we’ve got you covered. Here are the support options available
      to help you make the most of your experience:
    </Typography>

    <div class="mb-10">
      <Typography variant="heading4" as="h2">Astro Documentation</Typography>
      <Typography variant="body-small">
        This theme is built on <a
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a
        >, a fast and modern static site generator. If you’re new to Astro or
        want to deepen your understanding of how it works, the official Astro
        documentation is an excellent resource. Learn about key concepts,
        advanced features, and best practices to unlock the full potential of
        this theme.
      </Typography>
      <Typography variant="body-small">
        Visit the official Astro docs here: <a
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          href="https://docs.astro.build/en/getting-started/"
          >Astro Documentation</a
        >
      </Typography>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10">
      <Typography variant="heading4" as="h2">Report an Issue</Typography>
      <Typography variant="body-small" component="div">
        Found a bug or have a feature request? Let us know by opening an issue
        on the GitHub repository. Please include as much detail as possible so
        we can assist you effectively.
      </Typography>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10">
      <Typography variant="heading4" as="h2">Contact Us</Typography>
      <Typography variant="body-small" component="div">
        If you need further assistance, feel free to reach out directly. You can
        contact us at <a href="mailto:support@etchthemes.dev">support@etchthemes.dev</a>.
        We're committed to ensuring you have a smooth experience with the this
        theme. Don't hesitate to reach out—we're here to help!
      </Typography>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</Documentation>
